<title>JAPAN: Mars Engineering -6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mars Engineering -6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  7.13		vs	    7.72</p>
<p> Operating	    1.24		vs	    1.66</p>
<p> Current		1.11		vs	    1.58</p>
<p> Net		  632    million	  vs	  745    million</p>
<p> EPS		   61.10 yen	  vs	   72.08 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Mars Engineering Corp develops and produces management systems for prizes won at pachinko game parlours and other electronic equipment.</p>
